==Battleground==
*2 [[Haterbaa 2.0]]s (200%) spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Haterbaa 2.0]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn, delay 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
**10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**20 [[Haterbaa 2.0]]s (200%) spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**2 [[Samurai Doggy|Samurai Doggies]] spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|Anti-Dark]] units are recommended for beating this stage, preferably units with [[Slow|slow]] or [[Freeze|freeze]]. As long as you have enough [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitters]], the HaterBaas shouldn't be too big of a problem.

